Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.18,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what's best for me\NAnd you do it your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.82,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.88,0:01:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone. We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The page
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard him, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.82,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep up the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.84,0:02:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You really believe Straw\NHat will defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You really believe that\NWano's borders will open?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a fairytale ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a damn child!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm losing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our samurai are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not waiting for Luffy,\Nwe're facing you head on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die beside you if I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.34,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thrive Thrive Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.20,0:04:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Robot, Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.94,0:04:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The samurai don't have a leader\Nanymore if that Brad's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to broadcast his\Ndeath to the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll surrender, of course, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.54,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's crush their spirits!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.98,0:04:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Big crow is coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make our way to the performance\Nfloor just like we planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound good? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If Lucci is doing his best,\Nthen we will as well. Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my climatac talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.92,0:04:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Nami. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a face, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.92,0:04:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeepers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think Straw\NHat could defeat Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.66,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid, or is this some joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:05:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just hoping I'd have the\Npleasure of killing him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as he's dead, at least\Nhe won't be a thorn in my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking as someone that's\Nworked with him for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.56,0:05:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling he'll survive, even\Nif it doesn't make any damn sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who asked you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's the enemy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.08,0:05:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.36,0:05:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At this once, we can form an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.72,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo hoo hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm such a genius that my\Ngenius even surpassed myself! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I made that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So if it can talk, it must be my\Ndoing! What? No! Look, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all buzzers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.94,0:05:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Last I saw, that other cloud ate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.84,0:05:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How the heck did you end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After Mama grabbed me, my\Nspirit started leaving my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was lost in a daze. Powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And that Lady Hera was gonna couple me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a snack out of pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them and run, okay, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.52,0:06:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you stretched out your\Nweapon and offered me a snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat them! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.36,0:06:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.42,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's dinner time for moi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.74,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I guess when Hera bit me, it\Nsmushed my body into your rod thingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama came back to life, good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine for you, but\Nit's a pain in the butt for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you saved me,\Nyou haven't forgiven me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.88,0:07:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have so much power anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could just find\Nit in your heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.38,0:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, bud!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.68,0:07:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, that looks like the stage Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go there and give a command, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You listening, Onigashima?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.96,0:07:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hot news!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.87,0:07:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's leader, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.66,0:07:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to interrupt, ma'am,\Nbut the Sawhats are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a haughty lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.86,0:07:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Haughty Mortar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.32,0:07:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This brat is the real problem! Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of her, our gifters started\Nbetraying each other one after the other!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,She even got Big Mom on her side! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.34,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She took that attack from Big\NMom and got right back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.44,0:07:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pei-Pei got beat up because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.24,0:07:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you to leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.50,0:08:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen it do that before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mommy, just use your\Nbaton like you always do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll add attacks of my own!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.62,0:08:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your skin's too tough\Nfor us to break through!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead, we'll damage her\Ninsides like Mama's attack did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.50,0:08:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,One good lightning blast\Nshould do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that'll cause too much destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep Otama's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Capote?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.60,0:08:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Green Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I separated them! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Luffy's defeat\Nwould shut the samurai down,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:09:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,but not a single one of them surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to brief you on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.20,0:09:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A total of 5,000 troops on both sides\Nhave been rendered unfit for combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When the battle began,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the Beast Pirates had 24,000\Nfighters and the Rebels had 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.26,0:09:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.17,0:09:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,all of the pleasures and\Nwaiters on the performance
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,floor seemed to have turned\Nagainst Master Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So the enemy gained 4,000 recruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,At present,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the Beast Pirates have roughly 20,000\Ntroops and the Rebels have roughly 7,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to see the gap\Nbegin to close so late in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation is completely volatile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.76,0:09:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,On that note, we just received a report\Nthat might cause another shift in balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.62,0:09:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They came here to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pack it up, you traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The Gifters are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.16,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So the pleasures and waiters of this\Nflirt revolted against Master Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What, do they have a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not very smart, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those peons are supposed to be\Nsacrificed at times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Trash has no right to complain\Nabout being taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe out every traitor on the floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.88,0:10:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Punch! Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Rutheran, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thundercloud, you're up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeus, you're out! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.86,0:10:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'd call\Nme Zeus anymore. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cool new me after all, so why\Ndon't you give me a cool new name?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.22,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.26,0:11:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stick with Zeus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get to Nami,\Nyou gotta go through me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it your best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.14,0:11:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sick of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been playing tag for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.06,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.32,0:11:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.10,0:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:12:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my job to hit my target,\Nand that's what I'm gonna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And these are the OG!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And with page one already done,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they've managed to take out\Ntwo papers to tell me so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.74,0:12:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.46,0:12:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are these guys a lot\Nstronger than we thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not actually losing, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.26,0:12:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on Onigashima\Ncan hear you freaking out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.56,0:12:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.76,0:12:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot I was still broadcasting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, did I say, baby lady Aokiji?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.54,0:13:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant baby Robin Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.74,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So she works as a transmitter, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, green star, devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.70,0:13:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how her power works,\Nbut that girl is like a transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you make a command, the\Nwhole island will hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.82,0:14:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama is here What's she doing It's not safe\Nfor her here It's her Go get her master
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One more round!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,One more kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.60,0:14:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful, isn't it, Otokon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.16,0:15:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire festival is our time\Nto honor those we've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We build a fire to reach\Nthem in heaven itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Daddy can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There isn't a cloud in the sky, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's watching\Nover you and watching
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,over the fate of this\Ncountry he loved so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,someone's there what you're right i see\Nsomething wait a sec is that Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did you hear him underwater?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:15:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares? Just bring him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He might be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose baby is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.56,0:16:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a battlefield!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And what the hell did you do to Bao Huang?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.70,0:16:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.61,0:16:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.98,0:16:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to complain\Nabout being outnumbered?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems pretty unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was 5,000 versus\N30,000 when we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.06,0:16:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what everyone expected\Nfrom the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.22,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-on-one battle was\Nnever in the cards for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.44,0:16:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How annoyingly pragmatic of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job is to keep the top\Nofficers busy till Luffy wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.88,0:16:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,so grumble as long as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one after another with these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They knock them down, and more show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Strength and determination mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what matters in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this isn't a\Nbattle, it's an Alto war.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your own fault for getting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she still doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.32,0:17:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking at her pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone take care of that brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, on it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, hurry. Wait, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all of my friends do STB Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.12,0:17:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you switch sides, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro, Lumi, and Mama\NNatsuka, do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to have some fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's all work together\Nand turn down Carter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.10,0:18:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they'll listen to you just\Nbecause you ass nice, you dumb brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for\Nputting it on my show!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.24,0:18:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wish is my command!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take down Tidal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's start with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.06,0:18:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, General Briscola? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.80,0:18:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're here to take out some\Ntraitors, so let's stomp them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I heard you\Nloud and clear, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.94,0:18:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start out with a Gorilla\NPunch-Punch, just for you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.66,0:19:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, looks like\NMaster's given the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.52,0:19:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Gazelle Man, Daifugo, it's\Ntime to join the fight. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.70,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all the dipters trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.94,0:19:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Gifters, lend me your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight for our wonderful\Nmaster with all we've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.90,0:19:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:19:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Bryce!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's all floated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.54,0:20:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I told you to shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not helping at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.60,0:20:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain can help if you were here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.86,0:20:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to clear his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Boobside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.08,0:20:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if he wasn't dead, you\Nmight have just killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's rubber, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.12,0:20:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope he will at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that rubber's burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:21:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He missed you! He missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He missed you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.86,0:21:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But like kites, we rise\Nhighest against the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Neempo, great kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.90,0:21:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.08,0:21:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now if I can just find a place to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.64,0:21:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We escaped from that horrible\Nplace, but what costs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.68,0:21:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think they could still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.34,0:21:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,KIKU!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.92,0:21:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,KINEMAN!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,EVERYONE!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.50,0:22:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.36,0:22:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you mean father,\Ndon't you, Yamato?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.26,0:22:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to finally cut ties with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.88,0:22:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.76,0:22:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is sunk into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.26,0:22:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin's son suffered the same fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.74,0:22:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have the will to fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.86,0:22:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you should have protected\Nthem while you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:22:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.50,0:23:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both much stronger than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I fight beside them, as equals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.94,0:23:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And what happens after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're gonna\Nbreak free of this country?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.18,0:23:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy will show me the\Nworld you've kept from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I leave here, I'm\Nkicking you out of this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of water is extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.26,0:23:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.46,0:23:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat me, and I'll never leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So stay with me, and become\Nthe Shogun of this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.26,0:23:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you no!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.26,0:24:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know I won't be\Nthe one to defeat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he's the man Kozuki\NOden was waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.14,0:24:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll return stronger than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.02,0:24:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is\Nkeep you busy till then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.38,0:24:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to go easy on you, Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.68,0:24:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
